#   median   median of the per-launch medians -- the value to quote.
#   r2r      run-to-run scatter as a factor, max/min of those medians.
#   scatter  (max-min)/median ACROSS launches: Timing::spreadPct()'s own
#            arithmetic, so it reads directly against the next column.
#   within   median of the per-launch spread column -- what one launch
#            reports about itself, and all it can report.
